<title>GEORGIA: Georgian November inflation quickens to 1.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Georgian November inflation quickens to 1.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TBILISI 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Georgia's monthly consumer price inflation was 1.1 percent in November after 0.4 percent in October, the Department for Social and Economic Information said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    GEORGIAN CONSUMER PRICES   NOV 96    OCT 96    NOV 95</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change	  +1.1	+0.4	+0.1</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	   +16.6     +15.6    +139.9</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
